+### 5.9 conversation_list
+
+Conversation lists are sent only in answer to `list_conversations`, never unsolicited. With `transport.history` absent or disabled, or when the configured store cannot list, the server answers `UNSUPPORTED`; an unexpected listing failure answers `SERVER_ERROR` without store details, and neither case substitutes an empty list. These errors leave the socket open ([validated by: reports unsupported or failed listing as errors without closing the socket or inventing an empty list](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L189)).
